# Claude Code worktrees live under .claude/worktrees/<name>/ — they're
# independent checkouts of the same repo, not files that belong in any
# commit. Ignoring the directory keeps `git status` clean in whichever
# checkout is the "main" one and prevents `git add -A` from walking into
# a sibling worktree by mistake.
.claude/
